  "hintHomeTitle": "How to Journey on Home",
  "hintHomeDesc": "[Steps & Timeline Progression]\nYour steps advance human history from antiquity (700s BCE) toward the modern era at the rate of 1 step = approx. 1 day. Steps sync automatically in the background even when closed.\n\n[Eras & Scenery]\n• Tap the top date button to read in-depth historical context and image titles for your current era.\n• As you accumulate steps, you will advance to new eras, automatically updating the background scenery.\n• Crossing a 100-year century mark triggers a special celebration, offering store reviews on milestone centuries and interstitial ads on others.\n\n[Collecting Artifacts]\n• Bottom-Right ★ Button: After a 4-hour cooldown, watch a short video to discover an uncollected artifact from your current era.\n• Daily Step Milestones: Reaching 6,000 and 10,000 steps each day also guarantees an artifact reward.",
  "hintHistoryTitle": "How to View History Collection",
  "hintHistoryDesc": "[Collection Layout]\nAll unlocked eras and discovered artifacts from your odyssey are neatly cataloged century by century.\n\n[Item Details]\n• Tap any century header to expand or collapse the item cards.\n• Tap an item to open a detailed modal showing discovery dates, full images, and rich historical stories.\n\n[History vs. Hall of Fame]\n• This History tab displays items collected during your current journey (round).\n• The Hall of Fame in the side menu provides an encyclopedia of all discoveries made across every journey.",
