  "hintStepsTitle": "Step Data & Milestones",
  "hintStepsDesc": "[Tracking Mechanism]\nConnected directly to device health sensors (iOS HealthKit / Android Activity Recognition) to track your daily and overall activity.\n\n[Step Metrics & Charts]\n• View your Today's Steps alongside your overall Total Steps from day one.\n• The interactive bar chart illustrates your activity over the past 7 days—tap any bar to inspect specific daily counts.\n\n[Milestone Rewards]\n• 6,000 Steps: Hitting this daily fitness goal awards one guaranteed artifact.\n• 10,000 Steps: Advancing nearly 27 years of history in a single day awards a second guaranteed artifact.\n* Even if synced in batches above 10,000 steps, rewards for 6,000 and 10,000 steps are processed sequentially.",
